  "ambiguities": [
    "300 µW limits: 0.314/0.318 mW in both procedure tables (used here) but 0.313/0.319 mW in the 438A.pdf Test Record.",
    "-10 dBm row printed with min/max reversed; corrected here.",
    "Instrument accuracy spec reads ±0.2% on the 438A.pdf test page but ±0.02 dB in Table 1-1 and the OSM.",
